Z||000000||Raydar||05-04-2000||05:45 PM||||Okay... I suspect you all have heard about this, already. <BR>There is a virus similar to "Melissa" going around.<BR>If you receive an e-mail message with the Subject: ILOVEYOU, delete it. Do not open it.<BR>There is a .vbs attachment that is really nasty. Check this link for more info, technical details. <A HREF="http://www.europe.datafellows.com/v-descs/love.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.europe.datafellows.com/v-descs/love.htm</A> ||||reg||1
